{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2022-08-19 09:00:00', 'title': 'INVESTORS HERITAGE RANKS AS THE FASTEST-GROWING U.S. INSURER IN 2021 ACCORDING TO S&P GLOBAL', 'text': 'FRANKFORT, KY.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #ANNUITY--INVESTORS HERITAGE LIFE INSURANCE COMPANY (“INVESTORS HERITAGE”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT RANKED AS THE FASTEST-GROWING U.S. LIFE AND ANNUITY INSURER IN 2021, ACCORDING TO A NEW REPORT FROM S&P GLOBAL.1 INVESTORS HERITAGE RANKED AS THE FASTEST-GROWING U.S. ANNUITY INSURER IN BOTH TOTAL DIRECT PREMIUMS AND CONSIDERATIONS AS WELL AS DIRECT FIRST-YEAR PREMIUMS AND SINGLE PREMIUMS, A MEASURE OF NEW BUSINESS PRODUCTION, WITH 2021 TOTAL VOLUMES UP 73.8% FROM 2019.'}